From 1fbed45a2abcdd2a0669e2690f4dd88959c375df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:20:40 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/24] kcm_desktoptheme: theme list read after the first
 frame, previews built one card at a time, empty and busy states
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: Gallery (docs/page-design.md section 5). Config key (plasmarc Theme/name), pending deletion, KNS, install from
file, plasmathemeexplorer launch and the preview drawing are unchanged. NOT BUILT YET (owner stopped heavy work); checked
statically only.

Moved / renamed: no visible wording changed. Install from File… and Get New… were already page actions top right; Edit
Theme… / Remove / Don't delete stay GridDelegate actions; search and the All/Light/Dark/Color-compatible filter stay in the
header. New: "No Plasma styles found / match" empty state, busy indicator only after 150 ms. The KCM has no other options, so
no sub-page. Relabel table: inventory/relabel/kcm_desktoptheme.tsv (outer repo). Inventory --strict: 6 rows ok, 0 lost.
HIG ids: HIG-001, HIG-006; page-design sections 5, 7.

Speed (cause found in code, not measured):
- KCMDesktopTheme::load() ran ThemesModel::load() synchronously (themesmodel.cpp load()): locateAll plasma/desktoptheme, a
  directory listing per root, QFile::exists per theme, KPluginMetaData::fromJsonFile or KDesktopFile per theme, and for every
  theme with its own colors file a KSharedConfig open plus KColorScheme::createApplicationPalette, then a sort. Now queued one
  event-loop turn later (generation counter, new property KCMDesktopTheme.loaded); the grid has no model until loaded.
- Every card created a ThemePreview in the first frame: several KSvg.FrameSvgItem/SvgItem plus kcm.applyPlasmaTheme per
  card (each loads that theme's SVGs). The thumbnail is now a Loader { asynchronous: true } so cards are built incrementally.
- After numbers: pending, manager will measure.

Not built yet; uncertain: that GridDelegate.thumbnail accepts a Loader (it is an Item, the previous value was one); that the
asynchronous Loader keeps the placeholder look until a card is ready (empty card for a moment).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
